                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_67683176">If active</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_977644320">The component shall set the DTC If?- secured pdu can't be verified within 0.7 ms (main frequency:80MHz)  ?OR?If MAC Generation or verification fails for 3 consecutive messages.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_599137725">The component shall clear the DTC immediately If MAC Generation/Verification is successful once.</SD>
