                                <DTC ID="DTCB23C300" OID="34f295ab-b111-4455-be45-0cf75cf4110f">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCB23C300</SHORT-NAME>
                                    <TROUBLE-CODE>10732288</TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>B23C300</DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <TEXT TI="TI_2022158304">AHL driver motor left communication failure

HeadlampLevelingMotor Communication error LEFT
signal name : CommMotLostL</TEXT>
                                    <SDGS>
                                        <SDG SI="EXTRAINFO">
                                            <SD SI="Service_Relevant" TI="TI_1788665557">service at next halt</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_1133165657">AML/Johnson recommendations :
1. Check Wiring Harness between LuMEMS and Levellers/motors
2. Check Left motor (actions steps to be defined)
3. Change Left Motor
4. Change LuMEMS ECU</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_568240341">ECU is awake and communication active</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1660869490">Continuous</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_2022810503">90ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_2082912201">LIN signal LIN4:LUM_BCM_4::CommMotLostL has a value of 0x01 for three cycles.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1116004080">LIN signal LIN4:LUM_BCM_4::CommMotLostL has a value of 0x00 for three cycles.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1746220485">Record the DTC
Disable AHL functionality 
BCM_LUM_1::PowerOff=0x1

Motor frozen on last position</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1084019910">After 100 IGN ON to OFF cycles,clear history DTC automatically

Note: IGN ON (PhyTccStsBody=ON) when reset happen, aging counter shall re-initialize. Once DTC status change to current, aging counter shall re-initialize</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_669392925">1.When the LIN communication is inactive (stable
recessive or dominant value) for duration of 4.46 s
2. LIN wire is unconnected on Left levellers/motors
3. Power wires are unconnected on Left levellers/motors</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_1874940895">1.AHL does not work properly</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
                                <DTC ID="DTCB23C400" OID="83f4e556-5aa3-4802-b6cb-66d35a17f8c3">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCB23C400</SHORT-NAME>
