                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1084019910">After 100 IGN ON to OFF cycles,clear history DTC automatically

Note: IGN ON (PhyTccStsBody=ON) when reset happen, aging counter shall re-initialize. Once DTC status change to current, aging counter shall re-initialize</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_81557954">1.When the LIN communication is inactive (stable
recessive or dominant value) for duration of 4.46 s
